    <div class="section" style="text-align:center;" id="mission">
        <p class="label">Our Mission</p>
        <h2 class="section-h">From Clinic to Real-World Impact</h2>
        <p class="mission-statement">
            We are building Tafelberg Ventures as the innovation and venture-building platform of FN Olomouc —
            <strong>bridging clinical excellence with entrepreneurial capital</strong>.
            Our aim is to turn medical research, biomedical expertise, and hospital data into real-world health solutions
            that improve patients' lives, and to support clinicians, researchers, and innovators
            in developing ideas with genuine patient impact —
            through spin-offs, commercial partnerships, and open innovation.
        </p>
